    "Experiments.SingleCutSpan.serial_card": "Experiments.SingleCutSpan.serial_card : ∀ (e c : ℕ) (u : Finset ℕ),\n  (Experiments.SingleCutSpan.serial e c u).card = c + 2 + u.card",
